{"meta":{"id":"cee:190135","type":"series","name":"عائد للحبّ والوطن","poster":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/8429ED7D-5D4F-07BD-82CD-CBFCA9E3BAD0_poster.jpg","background":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/8429ED7D-5D4F-07BD-82CD-CBFCA9E3BAD0_poster.jpg","description":"The drama is set in 1900 to 1905 and tells the story of a soldier in the righteous army falling in love with an aristocrat's daughter. It begins in 1871 when the hero boards an American military ship as a little boy during the Shinmiyangyo, a U.S. military expedition to Korea that resulted in a battle. He lands in the U.S. and then years later returns to Korea as an American soldier,to the country that abandoned him. While stationed in Korea, he'll meet and fall in love with a nobleman's daughter.","releaseInfo":"2018","genres":["دراما"],"cast":["Byung-hun Lee","Daniel Joey Albright","Tae-ri Kim"],"director":[],"imdbRating":"8.8","runtime":"74 min","videos":[{"id":"cee:190135","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 1","season":1,"episode":1,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/8429ED7D-5D4F-07BD-82CD-CBFCA9E3BAD0_poster.jpg","released":"2018-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"cee:190139","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 2","season":1,"episode":2,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/FBF41274-B747-0F01-53DF-9CBFE456BB32_poster.jpg","released":"2018-01-02T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"cee:190141","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 3","season":1,"episode":3,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/FBF41274-B747-0F01-53DF-9CBFE456BB32_poster.jpg","released":"2018-01-03T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"cee:190143","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 4","season":1,"episode":4,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/FBF41274-B747-0F01-53DF-9CBFE456BB32_poster.jpg","released":"2018-01-04T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"cee:190145","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 5","season":1,"episode":5,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/FBF41274-B747-0F01-53DF-9CBFE456BB32_post